    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d817-a1">

                <pb facs="0965" n="871" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg871"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure in No. 1014—Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Jewett to Mr. Short.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Sivas</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-09-27"><hi rendition="#italic">September 27,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I think the guarding of Americans and their property is highly necessary and
                    should not be discontinued until the country is tranquilized by some radical
                    change.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">M. A. Jewett.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
